{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "1c13f010-086f-40bb-9a72-c325d0f72bab",
    "name": "Sovra - Documentos Firmados",
    "description": "Colección para la API de documentos firmados: emisión, visibilidad, listado y lectura pública.\n\n**Variables requeridas:**\n\n- `base_url`: URL base de la API (sin slash final)\n    \n- `api_key`: API key del workspace (solo endpoints /issuer)\n    \n- `schema_id`: id del schema de tipo document\n    \n- `document_id`: id del documento (se autocompleta tras emitir)\n    \n\nNotas:\n\n- El esquema `Bearer` se compara de forma literal; `bearer` en minúsculas devuelve 401.\n    \n- Los endpoints `/api/v1/documents/...` no llevan API key.\n    \n- La emisión valida, firma y ancla en una sola llamada: puede tardar hasta \\~90 segundos.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_exporter_id": "44641457",
    "_collection_link": "https://go.postman.co/collection/44641457-1c13f010-086f-40bb-9a72-c325d0f72bab?source=collection_link"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Issuer (requiere API key)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Emitir documento",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201) {\n    const body = pm.response.json();\n    pm.collectionVariables.set('document_id', body.id);\n    console.log('document_id guardado:', body.id);\n    console.log('status:', body.status);\n}\n\npm.test('201 Created', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));\npm.test('credential presente', () => {\n    pm.expect(pm.response.json().credential).to.be.a('string');\n});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{api_key}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"schema_id\": \"{{schema_id}}\",\n  \"claims\": {\n    \"claim_key\": \"valor\"\n  },\n  \"visibility\": \"private\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/issuer/documents",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "issuer",
                "documents"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Emite un documento con un schema previamente diseñado. Una sola llamada valida, firma y ancla: esperar hasta ~90 segundos.\n\n→ 201 si se creó exitosamente. **Conservar el `credential`**: ese string es el documento, autocontenido y verificable.\n\nErrores: 409 workspace_not_provisioned, 422 wrong_schema_kind / missing_claims / invalid_visibility, 503 chain_not_configured."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Cambiar visibilidad → public",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test('visibility = public', () => {",
                  "    pm.expect(pm.response.json().visibility).to.eql('public');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{api_key}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/issuer/documents/{{document_id}}/visibility/public",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "issuer",
                "documents",
                "{{document_id}}",
                "visibility",
                "public"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Publica el documento. El valor viaja como último segmento del path, no en un body.\n\nEsto restringe los endpoints de la API, no el artefacto: una credencial ya entregada sigue siendo verificable por quien la tenga. La visibilidad no está cubierta por la firma."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Cambiar visibilidad → private",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test('visibility = private', () => {",
                  "    pm.expect(pm.response.json().visibility).to.eql('private');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{api_key}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/issuer/documents/{{document_id}}/visibility/private",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "issuer",
                "documents",
                "{{document_id}}",
                "visibility",
                "private"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Vuelve el documento a privado. Cierra el enlace, no las copias ya entregadas."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Listar documentos del workspace",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test('array documents presente', () => {",
                  "    pm.expect(pm.response.json().documents).to.be.an('array');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{api_key}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/issuer/documents",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "issuer",
                "documents"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Lista todos los documentos del workspace, del más reciente al más antiguo. Sin paginación. Cada entrada tiene la misma forma que la respuesta de emisión, `credential` y `claims` decodificados incluidos."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Público (sin API key)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Obtener documento (JSON)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK (público) o 401 (privado)', () => {",
                  "    pm.expect([200, 401]).to.include(pm.response.code);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    pm.test('credential presente', () => {",
                  "        pm.expect(pm.response.json().credential).to.be.a('string');",
                  "    });",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/documents/{{document_id}}",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "documents",
                "{{document_id}}"
              ]
            },
            "description": "El documento, para quien recibió el enlace. Sin `/issuer` en el path y sin API key: si el documento es público, tener el id es toda la autorización. Uno privado necesita sesión del dashboard (una API key no sirve → 401 authentication_required).\n\nSolo `credential` es verificable; el resto es para renderizar. Responde con `Access-Control-Allow-Origin: *`."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "base_url",
      "value": "https://api.example.com"
    },
    {
      "key": "api_key",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "schema_id",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "document_id",
      "value": ""
    }
  ]
}